# Binaries.  ANCHORED with a leading slash on purpose: a bare "sgx_join" also
# matches the DIRECTORY baselines/batching/main/sgx_join/, which silently drops
# that engine's main.cpp from the repo and leaves a tree whose own Makefile
# cannot build it.  (The batching engine arrived here with exactly that bug, via
# a bare "debug/" rule swallowing app/debug/.)
/sgx_join
/sgx_app
/decrypt_result
/test_query_parser
/test_table_reader
/test_join_tree_serializer
/baselines/batching/sgx_app
/baselines/batching/encrypt_tables

# Run outputs and fetched baselines
output/
external/
higgs-data/
baselines/obliviator/query_results/
__pycache__/
